          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "9. Suppose the ‘+’ and ‘–’ symbols cannot be read on a battery. Suggest a method to identify the two terminals of this battery."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.446,
            0.744,
            0.504
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10. You are given six cells marked "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm { A } _ { i }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " B, C, D, E, and F. Some of these are working and some are not. Design an activity to identify which of them are working."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.508,
            0.502,
            0.529
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) List the items that you require."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.531,
            0.599,
            0.553
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) Write the procedure that you will follow."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.556,
            0.743,
            0.595
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) With the items, carry out the activity to identify the cells that are working."
